[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 34025.87, "timestamp": "09:27:05", "text": "，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34046.11, "timestamp": "09:27:26", "text": "該死。你沖我喊？什麼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34048.23, "timestamp": "09:27:28", "text": "意思？我沒對你喊。佩奇。哦，對，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34049.99, "timestamp": "09:27:29", "text": "忘了。呃，我在匈牙利受傷了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34054.55, "timestamp": "09:27:34", "text": "。我當時想抽她，終於抽到了，抽了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34056.31, "timestamp": "09:27:36", "text": "好多次，終於在一個池子裡抽到了，我當時就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34072.586, "timestamp": "09:27:52", "text": "哇，終於抽到琪亞娜了，她看起來好可愛。是啊，某種程度上，"}]